flowchart TB
    Start([User prompt]) --> Classify{Router node<br/>condition:if}

    Classify -->|billing| Billing[Billing branch]
    Classify -->|technical| Technical[Technical branch]
    Classify -->|general| General[General branch]

    Billing --> B1[Extract account id]
    Technical --> T1[Retrieve relevant docs]
    General --> G1[Draft answer]

    B1 --> B2[Lookup invoice]
    T1 --> T2[Run code diagnostic]

    B2 --> Merge
    T2 --> Merge
    G1 --> Merge

    Merge[Merge results] --> Review{Human review?}
    Review -->|auto| Output[Return result]
    Review -->|manual| Queue[Escalation queue]

    style Start fill:#151517,stroke:#ec4899,stroke-width:2px
    style Output fill:#151517,stroke:#ec4899,stroke-width:2px
    style Classify fill:#1c1c1f,stroke:#ec4899
    style Merge fill:#1c1c1f,stroke:#ec4899
